<title>USA: CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 29.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 29.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT notices for delivery against the August soybean contract on August 30 (In thousand bushels).</p>
<p>SOYBEANS - 30 bushels. Oldest long - August 21, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - combs/h 65 25, 1st option/c 5.</p>
<p>Received - term commodities/h 25, 1st option/h 5.</p>
<p>H=House account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
